sentence:
Calculate each sum:
\[
\sum_{i=0}^{\infty} a_i^2 = \sum_{i=0}^{\infty} (a_0 r_a^i)^2 = a_0^2 \sum_{i=0}^{\infty} r_a^{2i} = \frac{a_0^2}{1 - r_a^2}
\]
\[
\sum_{i=0}^{\infty} b_i^2 = \sum_{i=0}^{\infty} (b_0 r_b^i)^2 = b_0^2 \sum_{i=0}^{\infty} r_b^{2i} = \frac{b_0^2}{1 - r_b^2}
\]
\[
\sum_{i=0}^{\infty} a_i b_i = \sum_{i=0}^{\infty} (a_0 r_a^i)(b_0 r_b^i) = a_0 b_0 \sum_{i=0}^{\infty} (r_a r_b)^i = \frac{a_0 b_0}{1 - r_a r_b}
\]
